'''Knattspyrnufélagið Haukar''' ({{IPA|is|ˈkʰnahtˌspɪ(r)tnʏˌfjɛːˌlaijɪð ˈhøyːkar̥}}, {{lit|Hawks Football Club}}{{efn|''Knattspyrnufélagið'' is the [[Definiteness|definite form]] of ''Knattspyrnufélag'', meaning "the football club".}}) is an [[Iceland]]ic multi-sport club from [[Hafnarfjörður]] with divisions in [[Association football|Football]], [[Haukar Handball|Handball]], [[Basketball]], [[Haukar RC|Rugby union]], [[Karate]], [[Skiing]] & [[Chess]]."}}
